OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSkies will be cloudy at first
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain at times. Rain
OL,7,Fwill sink south through the morning
OL,8,Fbringing a brighter afternoon for
OL,9,Fmany. However, staying cloudy in the
OL,10,Fsouth for much of the day. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud and rain gradually
OL,13,Fclearing the south to leave largely
OL,14,Fclear skies tonight. Staying dry after
OL,15,Fmidnight with easing winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA fine day on Sunday with
OL,18,Flighter winds and plenty of sunny
OL,19,Fspells. The sunshine may turn hazy at
OL,20,Ftimes, but staying bright and feeling
OL,21,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
