OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPlenty
OL,6,Fof dry weather with sunny spells, and
OL,7,Fchilly nights at first with patchy
OL,8,Ffog. Turning warmer with temperatures
OL,9,Frising above average
